            // this file (e.g. `direction` above), and rules out any object-vs-array Chakra
            // resolution discrepancy as a variable. `flexBasis` set alongside `width` (both to
            // the same value) so the flex algorithm has an unambiguous main-size hint — with
            // only `width` set, a flex item's basis still defaults to `auto` before falling
            // back to `width`, which left this column free to claim more than 218px in
